    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Dooley Group bring to the market this 3 bedroom property located within the town of Newcastle West.\n\nThe property boasts an excellent location within the town limits and is connected to mains sewerage and water and Oil Fired Central heating. It`s prime location is within walking distance to the town centre and is adjacent to the West Limerick Athletics Hub.\n\nIn need of renovation the property should be eligible for the vacant home grant (subject to application) and would make a perfect home for any potential purchaser.\n\nThe property has a large detached garage and ample parking to the rear along with private driveway from the main road.\n\nViewing of the property is by appointment only through REA Dooley group on 069-61888\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
